{"seq":3,"slug":"selection-bias","title":"选择偏差：SAR 与倾向得分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/selection-bias","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"选择偏差-sar-与倾向得分\">选择偏差：SAR 与倾向得分</h1><p>前面所有方法都站在 SCAR 这块地基上——正例被完全随机地标注。可现实里，哪些正例会被标出来，几乎从不随机。医院里症状明显的病人更容易被确诊登记，风控里金额大的欺诈更容易被审出来，推荐里热门物品更容易被点击。被标注的正例，是从全体正例里<strong>有偏地</strong>抽出来的一小撮。当标注概率依赖样本特征时，SCAR 破裂，变成 SAR（Selected At Random）。本篇讲 SAR 如何让经典方法失灵、倾向得分与逆倾向加权如何补救、以及 SCAR 无法直接检验时的应对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-scar-vs-sar\">核心概念：SCAR vs SAR</h2><p>回到 <a href=\"../foundations/pu-scenarios\">PU 场景</a> 里的倾向得分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)=P(s=1\\mid y=+1,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，两种假设的分野就是它是否依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SCAR</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)\\equiv c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 常数。被标正例是全体正例的无偏缩样，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(s=1\\mid x)=c\\,P(y=+1\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 成立，经典方法有效。</li>\n<li><strong>SAR</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 变化。被标正例偏向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 高的区域，已标注池不再代表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，Elkan-Noto 恒等式失效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SAR 的危害在于它让「已标注正例」成了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>扭曲镜像</strong>：模型学到的是「哪些正例容易被标」，而非「哪些样本是正例」。若不纠正，决策边界会朝高倾向区域倾斜——把容易被标的正例识别得很好，把不容易被标的（往往是更需要发现的，如隐匿欺诈、早期病例）系统性漏掉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[全体正例 p_pos] --&gt; B{倾向 e_x}&#10;  B --&gt;|SCAR e=常数| C[已标注是无偏缩样&lt;br/&gt;Elkan-Noto 成立 经典法有效]&#10;  B --&gt;|SAR e依赖x| D[已标注偏向高倾向区域]&#10;  D --&gt; E[已标注是 p_pos 的扭曲镜像]&#10;  E --&gt; F[边界倾向易标区 漏判难标正例]&#10;  F --&gt; G[纠偏: 估倾向 e_x]&#10;  G --&gt; H[逆倾向加权 IPW&lt;br/&gt;每个已标正例乘 1/e_x]&#10;  G --&gt; I[PUSB / PULSNAR 等 SAR 专法]&#10;  H --&gt; J[还原无偏正例分布]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[全体正例 p_pos] --&gt; B{倾向 e_x}\n  B --&gt;|SCAR e=常数| C[已标注是无偏缩样&lt;br/&gt;Elkan-Noto 成立 经典法有效]\n  B --&gt;|SAR e依赖x| D[已标注偏向高倾向区域]\n  D --&gt; E[已标注是 p_pos 的扭曲镜像]\n  E --&gt; F[边界倾向易标区 漏判难标正例]\n  F --&gt; G[纠偏: 估倾向 e_x]\n  G --&gt; H[逆倾向加权 IPW&lt;br/&gt;每个已标正例乘 1/e_x]\n  G --&gt; I[PUSB / PULSNAR 等 SAR 专法]\n  H --&gt; J[还原无偏正例分布]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"逆倾向加权-sar-的核心武器\">逆倾向加权：SAR 的核心武器</h2><p>SAR 纠偏的主思路借自因果推断的逆倾向加权（Inverse Propensity Weighting，IPW）。直觉：一个被标注的正例，若它所在区域的倾向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 很低（本来很难被标却被标了），它就代表了一大片没被标出来的同类正例，应给它更大的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 来补偿；反之高倾向区域的样本已被过度采样，降权。Bekker 等（2020）据此把 SAR 下的经验风险改写为<strong>倾向加权</strong>版本：每个已标注正例按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 加权，就能无偏地还原全体正例上的风险，从而把 SAR 问题拉回到可解。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>SAR</mtext><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat R^+_{\\text{SAR}}(g)=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i:\\,s_i=1}\\frac{1}{e(x_i)}\\,\\ell(g(x_i),+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2304em;vertical-align:-0.2837em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4163em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SAR</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2837em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6992em;vertical-align:-1.3778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3778em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>问题随之转移：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 从哪来？这是 SAR 的真正难点，因为倾向本身不可直接观测。几条路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>倾向已知 / 可建模</strong>。某些场景倾向有领域含义（如按人群分层的检测率、按金额分档的审核率），可直接给定或用外部信息建模。这是最干净的情形，也是 Bekker 等理论的标准假设——「倾向对已标注实例已知」。</li>\n<li><strong>用子特征把 SAR 归约成 SCAR</strong>。Bekker 等（2019）的观察：若倾向只依赖特征的某个子集，在这些子特征取值相同的样本内部，标注又变回随机（局部 SCAR）。据此可分层估计，把 SAR 分解成若干局部 SCAR 求解。</li>\n<li><strong>联合估计</strong>。用 EM 或变分方法同时估分类器与倾向，但可辨识性弱、需强假设或正则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sar-专法-pusb-pulsnar-与因果视角\">SAR 专法：PUSB、PULSNAR 与因果视角</h2><p>围绕 SAR 涌现了一批专门方法。<strong>PUSB</strong>（PU learning with Selection Bias）在「倾向由部分特征决定」的假设下，直接学一个对选择偏差鲁棒的排序 / 分类器。<strong>PULSNAR</strong>（Positive Unlabeled Learning Selected Not At Random，arXiv:2303.08269）针对 SCAR 不成立时的<strong>类别占比估计</strong>——它承认标注非随机，用样本聚类 + 分组的思路估计更真实的正类比例，弥补经典先验估计器在 SAR 下的系统偏差。因果视角的 <strong>PUe</strong>（用曝光 / exposure 数据与因果推断纠偏）与自动去偏方法（arXiv:2303.04797）则把「是否被曝光 / 被标注」显式建模为一个因果变量，用双重稳健等技术同时纠正倾向与结果模型的误设。</p>\n<p>下表把 SAR 应对手段按前提与产出对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>关键前提</th>\n<th>主要产出</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IPW 倾向加权</td>\n<td>倾向已知或可靠估计</td>\n<td>无偏风险 / 分类器</td>\n<td>倾向有领域含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子特征归约</td>\n<td>倾向只依赖子特征</td>\n<td>分层局部 SCAR</td>\n<td>能识别选择相关特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PUSB</td>\n<td>倾向由部分特征定</td>\n<td>鲁棒排序 / 分类</td>\n<td>选择偏差中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PULSNAR</td>\n<td>承认非随机标注</td>\n<td>更准的类先验</td>\n<td>先验估计在 SAR 下偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果 / 双重稳健</td>\n<td>有曝光信号或工具变量</td>\n<td>双重纠偏</td>\n<td>曝光可观测的推荐等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"无法直接检验的困境与实务建议\">无法直接检验的困境与实务建议</h2><p>一个令人不安的事实：<strong>仅凭 PU 数据，SCAR 通常无法被直接检验</strong>——你看不到未被标注正例的倾向，就无从判断标注是否随机（近年有工作，如 arXiv:2404.00145，尝试在附加假设下验证 SCAR，但非普适）。这意味着 SCAR 更多是一个需要<strong>领域判断</strong>的假设，而非可测事实。</p>\n<p>实务上给三条建议。其一，<strong>从标注流程反推</strong>：问清「这些正例是怎么被标出来的」——若标注依赖会进入模型的特征（金额、症状严重度、曝光量），几乎可以断定 SAR，别默认 SCAR。其二，<strong>留一个无偏审计集</strong>：花成本随机抽一小批样本做完整标注（含负例），它既能验证 SCAR、又能做可信评估（见 <a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a>），是打破 SAR 不可检验困境的最实在办法。其三，<strong>先验也要按 SAR 重估</strong>：SAR 会让经典 <a href=\"../methods/class-prior\">类先验估计</a> 偏，需换 PULSNAR 类方法或用审计集直接估。选型收束见 <a href=\"../practice/pu-in-practice\">PU 落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SCAR（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 常数）破裂为 SAR（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 依赖特征）时，已标注正例成为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的扭曲镜像，边界倾向易标区、漏判难标正例。</li>\n<li>核心纠偏是逆倾向加权：已标注正例按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 加权还原无偏风险；难点在估倾向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，可靠路线是倾向已知、子特征归约成局部 SCAR、或联合估计。</li>\n<li>SAR 专法包括 PUSB、PULSNAR（SAR 下的先验估计）与因果 / 双重稳健方法（PUe、自动去偏）。</li>\n<li>SCAR 一般不可从 PU 数据直接检验，须靠领域判断；实务上从标注流程反推是否 SAR、留无偏审计集验证与评估、并按 SAR 重估先验。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>倾向得分与 SCAR 的定义来源：<a href=\"../foundations/pu-scenarios\">PU 场景与 SCAR 假设</a></li>\n<li>SAR 下先验估计要换法：<a href=\"../methods/class-prior\">类先验估计</a></li>\n<li>审计集与无偏评估：<a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a></li>\n<li>另一类假设破裂：<a href=\"prior-shift\">先验偏移</a></li>\n<li>跨库对照——推荐里的曝光 / 隐式反馈偏差：<a href=\"../../recommender-systems/\">推荐系统</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"选择偏差：SAR 与倾向得分","id":"选择偏差-sar-与倾向得分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：SCAR vs SAR","id":"核心概念-scar-vs-sar"},{"level":2,"text":"逆倾向加权：SAR 的核心武器","id":"逆倾向加权-sar-的核心武器"},{"level":2,"text":"SAR 专法：PUSB、PULSNAR 与因果视角","id":"sar-专法-pusb-pulsnar-与因果视角"},{"level":2,"text":"无法直接检验的困境与实务建议","id":"无法直接检验的困境与实务建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"先验偏移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/prior-shift"},"next":{"title":"PU 评估：没有负例怎么打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/practice/pu-evaluation"}}